excepting creatures unsuited to speak by virtue of having no vocal cords 
or mouths, i think it would be tres amusant if some pets could speak. 
there would be a limited file of responses - far more than the imp 
insult list, for example - and some of the comments might even be 
helpful clues. for example; if you kick down a door, your pet might 
comment "nice going. now everyone in the dungeon knows you're here, and 
you don't have a key."

if you #chat to the pet it will tell you how it's feeling in detail. or 
it might just say "Don't ask me, Davey. I'm just a talkin' dawg."


